  "header": {
    "subsystemType": "Hrot.Scenario",
    "schemaVersion": "1.0",
    "terrainName": "basic-desert",
    "description": "What: CE-2493 open-field suite OF5 - on basic-desert's open field, a 6-man 'Blue Squad' moves east across it (InfantrySquadMove, a movement to contact) and meets 'Red Squad 1' and 'Red Squad 2' (12 men, two machine guns) defending the line at x 260-275 behind foxholes and sandbags. Judge: the COUNTERWEIGHT (ATP 3-21.8 break contact): outmatched 2 : 1 by men and by machine guns, the squad returns fire, then BREAKS CONTACT - suppressing and withdrawing cover to cover out of Red's sight - and never assaults or closes on the line. Fail: an assault on the line, a man upright in the open in Red's sight 10 s, or Blue still in Red's sight a minute after contact. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh of-squad-outmatched"
  },
